# FORLORN HOPE: the tower way can be won close to the original's best known
# run (13 lost). The demo player's expert plan, with real presses: the
# opening eight as in the demo (pit stone, key and plate 1, the runner's
# waystone and plate 2, the loose rock, the waystone by the gulper and plate
# 3, one volunteer fed to the gulper); then ONE mason duels the stingback
# with the mallet, climbs the tower, strikes the wall-eye and the bell and
# caps the drain; three sappers open the seal; and a last mason bursts all
# four hearts with the mallet and walks away. 12 lost.
game forlorn
cheat start 1
cheat bot_route 2
expect bot_plans == 13
botuntil lost >= 8 20000
expect first_on17 == 0
botuntil first_on16 == 0 4000
expect lost == 8
botuntil lost >= 9 9000
expect first_on11 == 0
expect tile21115 == 9
botuntil lost >= 12 20000
expect tile13120 == 0
botuntil phase == 3 9000
expect hearts == 0
expect lost == 12
expect lost <= 15
expect lives == 87
expect units == 13
expect bot_stuck == 0
botuntil state == 5 400
expect goals == 7
